# Normalize every text file to LF in the index, regardless of the OS that wrote it.
#
# Why this is a single broad rule instead of a per-extension list: a narrow
# .gitattributes leaves whole file classes (.json, .js, .mjs, .html, .yml) outside
# normalization. A mass write from a CRLF-defaulting tool then rewrites every line
# of those files, and `git diff --stat --exit-code` — the catalog-freshness gate in
# CI — fails on pure line-ending noise even when nothing actually drifted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never normalize, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.xmind binary
